 ],
 "notes": "96 picks. Centres read with darkness profiles across the double lines plus visual checks. Names as printed: EHRHARDT ST. (not Erhardt), MACKLIN ALLEY, APJONES ST., WILLIAMSON PLACE (north of Chase), DANE AVE. (used Dane Avenue throughout), MAD ANTHONY ST. (label split across Knowlton), split labels COATES..ALLEY, POPE..ALLEY, MEDILL..ALLEY. Alley names carried by continuity where only ALLEY is printed: Baltzer, Grey and Honer north of their labels; Lingo Alley = the diagonal LINGO ALLEY (Chase to Lingo St) plus the N-S alley from Medill to Palm (printed ALLEY / LINGO). Palm Street east of Hamilton is unlabelled, assumed to continue Palm (picks Lingo Alley/Palm, Langland/Palm). Jogs recorded as two tees: Hamilton/Knowlton (west arm N 4337605, east arm N 4337589); Williamson Place/Coates Alley (west arm 4337825, east arm 4337815). Beech Hill Ave (from N) and Armour Alley (from S) meet Pullan 9 m apart, recorded separately. Knowlton's Corner: Hamilton/Spring Grove, Hamilton/Hoffner and Spring Grove/Ludlow are within 20 m of each other. Hamilton/Blue Rock is crossed by the railroad at the same spot, good to about 3 m. Sheet seam near E 712617-712632 (west/east sheets) mismatches a few metres; Brookside, Lingo Alley and Honer picks sit on it. Dane Avenue runs on into Crawford Avenue across the railroad with no junction; Knowlton's east end stops at the railroad short of Spring Grove Ave; Bless St ends at an unnamed lane; Parker Ave dead-ends. Skipped: cemetery and Mt. Storm Park drives, VIADUCT, unnamed lanes. Kind 'corner' = L-junction where both streets end."
}